' and select the survey created in the first step\n\n- Click ''Add Task'' and select ''Zendesk Survey Campaign - Survey customers automatically when a ticket\u2019s status changes in Zendesk.''\n\n- Enter reply to email address(optional)\n\n- Enter subject\n\n- Click ''Edit this message'' to edit the message\u2014Toggle ''Embed First Question'' to embed the first question in the email body. Email for the first question is applicable when you have NPS, Rating Question, or multiple choice question as the survey''s first question.\n\n- Send an invite with a delay - Check this option to send a survey invit", "owner": "crawler", "space": "QWARY_HELP", "title": "Send post-resolution email surveys campaign", "doc_id": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/workflows/zendesk-workflow/send-post-resolution-email-surveys-campaign", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_b4c2e66fe35bfe5e", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "stale", "updated_at": "2023-05-26T03:38:08Z", "fusion_rank": 4, "heading_path": ["Send post-resolution email surveys campaign"], "rerank_score": 0.450789}, {"url": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/use-cases/segment-customers-for-email-sms-surveys", "span": "- Segment customers for Email/SMS Surveys\n\n# Segment customers for Email/SMS Surveys\n\nGain Insight from Your Customers at Every Step of their Journey with Segmented Email/SMS Surveys\n\n### 1. Go to Qwary - Projects\n\nSelect your survey\n\n### 4. Click on Send By Email\n\nGo to Email Campaign", "owner": "crawler", "space": "QWARY_HELP", "title": "Segment customers for Email/SMS Surveys", "doc_id": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/use-cases/segment-customers-for-email-sms-surveys", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_f63bf4a20108b561", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "stale", "updated_at": "2023-01-11T23:35:47Z", "fusion_rank": 14, "heading_path": [], "rerank_score": 0.564305}, {"url": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/launch-survey/bulk-email-surveys", "span": "- Bulk 