699000Z", "fusion_rank": 1, "heading_path": [], "rerank_score": 0.652471}, {"url": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/faq/gdpr-compliance", "span": "The GDPR has a broad definition for this term, and it generally encompasses any and all information about a specific person, including:\n\nName\n\nEmail address\n\nDate of birth\n\nPhysical address\n\nProfile photo\n\nSocial media username\n\nOr any other information that can lead to identifying a real person.", "owner": "crawler", "space": "QWARY_HELP", "title": "GDPR Compliance", "doc_id": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/faq/gdpr-compliance", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_b49987a78d71dad0", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "fresh", "updated_at": "2025-08-12T12:48:37.699000Z", "fusion_rank": 1, "heading_path": ["GDPR Compliance", "What does GDPR stand for?", "What \u201cpersonal data\u201d is"], "rerank_score": 0.650962}, {"url": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/faq/gdpr-compliance", "span": "Please reach out to us via intercom or send an email at support@qwary.com if you have any questions or need a DPA signed.\n\nWe respect the rights of individuals to know how their data is being used, export it, or request that it be deleted. Click here to fill up a form to make a data request.\n\nLast updated 1 year ago\n\n- What does GDPR stand for?\n\n- How did it come about?\n\n- What \u201cpersonal data\u201d is\n\n- How Qwary prepared for GDPR?\n\n- Who are Qwary''s data processing partners?\n\n- Privacy and Security Contact", "owner": "crawler", "space": "QWARY_HELP", "title": "GDPR Compliance", "doc_id": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/faq/gdpr-compliance", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_c4382b71dae9a2bb", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "fresh", "updated_at": "2025-08-12T12:48:37.699000Z", "fusion_rank": 1, "heading_path": ["GDPR Compliance", "What does GDPR stand for?", "Privacy and Security Contact"], "rerank_score": 0.614072}, {"url": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/compose-survey/website-feedback-button", "span": "- Enhanced user engagement and data enrichment: With Qwary''s \"Always on\" feedback button, you allow users to provide feedback on specific parts of your website. This feature encourages active engagement, allowing users to voice their opinions, suggestions, or concerns in real time. Additionally, Qwary captures relevant metadata on website users, including browser information, device details, and location. This enriched data provides a deeper context when analyzing feedback, enabling you to understand user experiences better and take targeted actions to improve satisfaction.\n\n- Brand-aligned cu", "owner": "crawler", "space": "QWARY_HELP", "title": "Website Feedback Button", "doc_id": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/compose-survey/website-feedback-button", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_9237651368ca6db3", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "stale", "updated_at": "2023-06-04T13:29:04Z", "fusion_rank": 2, "heading_path": ["Website Feedback Button"], "rerank_score": 0.316919}, {"url": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/installation/web/google-tag-manager", "span": "Last updated 3 years ago", "owner": "crawler", "space": "QWARY_HELP", "title": "Google Tag Manager", "doc_id": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/installation/web/google-tag-manager", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_59b2da56044959e3", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "stale", "updated_at": "2023-07-08T03:52:44.316000Z", "fusion_rank": 6, "heading_path": ["Google Tag Manager"], "rerank_score": 0.349073}, {"url": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/compose-survey/website-feedback-button", "span": "- Continuous improvement through data-driven insights: Qwary''s comprehensive analytics and reporting features enable you to extract actionable insights from the feedback collected. By analyzing the data, identifying trends, and uncovering pain points, you can make data-driven decisions to improve your website contin