 rotation for the owning space. Requests relating to stop payment are triaged within two business days.", "owner": "consumer.ops@wellsfargo.example", "space": "CONSUMER", "title": "Decision: Stop Payment", "doc_id": "CON-F0072", "labels": ["approved", "stop-payment"], "chunk_id": "chk_7034ca3db6940c47", "authority": "authoritative", "staleness": "stale", "updated_at": "2025-07-21T12:00:00Z", "fusion_rank": 8, "heading_path": ["Purpose", "Detail"], "rerank_score": 0.088004}, {"url": "https://ecm.example.com/consumer/policies/reg-e-error-resolution", "span": "The customer must be told the result within three business days of completing the investigation. Where the claim is denied, the notice must state the reason and offer the supporting documents.", "owner": "consumer.compliance@wellsfargo.example", "space": "CONSUMER", "title": "Regulation E Error Resolution Procedure", "doc_id": "CB-POL-2210", "labels": ["policy", "approved", "reg-e", "disputes"], "chunk_id": "chk_937444d2c5b48e96", "authority": "authoritative", "staleness": "fresh", "updated_at": "2026-05-18T12:00:00Z", "fusion_rank": 7, "heading_path": ["Scope", "Customer notification"], "rerank_score": 0.081055}], "conflicts": [], "followups": [{"because": "a section of \u201cConsumer Deposit Account Fee Schedule\u201d", "question": "What does the documentation say about Purpose?"}, {"because": "a section of \u201cChecklist: Stop Payment\u201d", "question": "What does the documentation say about Detail?"}, {"because": "the document \u201cChecklist: Stop Payment\u201d", "question": "What does the documentation say about Checklist: Stop Payment?"}, {"because": "the document \u201cDecision: Stop Payment\u201d", "question": "What does the documentation say about Decision: Stop Payment?"}], "answered_by": {"cited": [1], "model": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "grounded": true, "provider": "langchain"}, "refusal_reason": null}'::jsonb, '[{"name": "compile", "label": "Compiling scope and permissions", "detail": "plan pln_063b92