pportunity\n\n- Edit Case Object\n\nCreate a custom object for the Account\n\nBelow is the object definition\n\nObj", "owner": "crawler", "space": "QWARY_HELP", "title": "Map survey response data into Salesforce", "doc_id": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/workflows/salesforce-workflow/map-survey-response-data-into-salesforce", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_3bca1a7bb907836f", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "ageing", "updated_at": "2024-07-30T03:36:32.104000Z", "fusion_rank": 1, "heading_path": ["Map survey response data into Salesforce"], "rerank_score": 0.733905}, {"url": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/workflows/salesforce-workflow/map-survey-response-data-into-salesforce", "span": "Qwary CES\n\nQwary_CES__c\n\nNumber(18, 0)\n\nUsed if opportunity survey campaign has effort score question type\n\nQwary comment\n\nQwary_comment__c\n\nText Area(255)\n\nUsed if opportunity survey campaign has comment question type\n\nQwary CSAT\n\nQwary_CSAT__c\n\nNumber(18, 0)\n\nUsed if opportunity survey campaign has satisfaction question type\n\nQwary emotion\n\nQwary_emotion__c\n\nText(10)\n\nUsed if opportunity survey campaign has emotion question type\n\nQwary NPS\n\nQwary_NPS__c\n\nNumber(18, 0)\n\nused if opportunity survey campaign has NPS question type\n\nQwary rating\n\nQwary_rating__c\n\nNumber(18, 0)\n\nUsed if opportunity", "owner": "crawler", "space": "QWARY_HELP", "title": "Map survey response data into Salesforce", "doc_id": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/workflows/salesforce-workflow/map-survey-response-data-into-salesforce", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_8be59e9960b51fc9", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "ageing", "updated_at": "2024-07-30T03:36:32.104000Z", "fusion_rank": 1, "heading_path": ["Map survey response data into Salesforce"], "rerank_score": 0.724311}, {"url": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/workflows/salesforce-workflow/map-survey-response-data-into-salesforce", "span": "Lookup(User,Group)\n\nQwary Survey Name\n\nName\n\nText(80)\n\nSurvey name for the received response\n\nQwary Survey Response\n\nQwary_Survey_Response__c\n\nRich Text Area(100000)\n\nFormatted survey response\n\nCreate a custom object for the Contact\n\nBelow is the object definition\n\nObject Name\n\nQwary Survey Response - Contact\n\nAPI Name\n\nQwary_Survey_Response_Contact__c\n\nLabel\n\nQwary Survey Response - Contact\n\nPlural Label\n\nQwary Survey Responses - Contact\n\nRecord Type\n\nQwary Survey Name\n\nData Type\n\nText\n\nDeployment Status\n\nDeployed\n\nFields & Relationship\n\nContact\n\nContact__c\n\nLookup(Contact)\n\nCreated By\n\nCreat", "owner": "crawler", "space": "QWARY_HELP", "title": "Map survey response data into Salesforce", "doc_id": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/workflows/salesforce-workflow/map-survey-response-data-into-salesforce", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_fbdf7295ff917c07", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "ageing", "updated_at": "2024-07-30T03:36:32.104000Z", "fusion_rank": 1, "heading_path": ["Map survey response data into Salesforce"], "rerank_score": 0.703095}, {"url": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/workflows/zendesk-workflow/map-survey-response-data-into-zendesk", "span": "Last updated 3 years ago", "owner": "crawler", "space": "QWARY_HELP", "title": "Map survey response data into Zendesk", "doc_id": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/workflows/zendesk-workflow/map-survey-response-data-into-zendesk", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_f64f44bc39963b3c", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "stale", "updated_at": "2023-05-26T04:12:36Z", "fusion_rank": 2, "heading_path": ["Map survey response data into Zendesk"], "rerank_score": 0.635361}, {"url": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/workflows/zendesk-workflow/map-survey-response-data-into-zendesk", "span": "- Map survey response data into Zendesk Event-based Zendesk workflow\n\n# Map survey response data into Zendesk\n\nQwary''s Zendesk integration automates survey triggers and seamlessly synchronizes collected data with Zendesk records. Gain in-depth insights through in-context analysis, generating dynamic dashboards and reports while automating workflows for swift action based on valuable customer feedback. By merging survey data with Zendesk, you comprehensively understand customer interactions, ultimately improving satisfaction, strengthening business relationships, and fostering lasting connectio", "owner": "crawler", "space": "QWARY_HELP", "title": "Map survey response data into Zendesk", "doc_id": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/workflows/zendesk-workflow/map-survey-response-data-into-zendesk", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_bc5fb911282594f8", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "stale", "updated_at": "2023-05-26T04:12:36Z", "fusion_rank": 2, "heading_path": [], "rerank_score": 0.533759}, {"url": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/workflows/salesforce-workflow", "span": "- Map survey response data into Salesforce\n\n- Import contact data from Salesforce to Qwary\n\n# Salesforce Workflow\n\nDiscover customer insights through effective feedback measurement. This guide outlines a seven-step process to build mobile-friendly surveys and leverage Salesforce for actionable results.\n\nWith Qwary''s seamless integration into Salesforce, you can effortlessly initiate surveys following transactions or other significant events, enabling you to monitor customer sentiment effortlessly, update salesforce with response data when the survey is completed or import contact and account d", "owner": "crawler", "space": "QWARY_HELP", "title": "Salesforce Workflow", "doc_id": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/workflows/salesforce-workflow", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_96885cbcd71732e2", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "stale", "updated_at": "2023-06-05T13:48:15Z", "fusion_rank": 9, "heading_path": [], "rerank_score": 0.653016}, {"url": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/workflows/salesforce-workflow/import-contact-data-from-salesforce-to-qwary", "span": "- After saving your record, Click on consumer details and save the consumer key and secret.\n\nConnect Qwary to Salesforce with scheduler workflow.\n\n- Go to Workflows --> Create new workflow --> Select Schedule-based workflow, enter workflow name, and click ''Create.''\n\n- Click on ''Add Task.'' and add ''Extract contact and/or account data from Salesforce Account.''\n\n- Select opportunity or case email campaign and click ''connect.''\n\n- Click on ''Connect'' again from the Salesforce integration overview page.\n\n- Enter the Salesforce account username, password, consumer key, and consumer secret (from step 2", "owner": "crawler", "space": "QWARY_HELP", "title": "Import contact data from Salesforce to Qwary", "doc_id": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/workflows/salesforce-workflow/import-contact-data-from-salesforce-to-qwary", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_d3431b03264c6e4c", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "stale", "updated_at": "2023-05-25T15:50:41Z", "fusion_rank": 3, "heading_path": ["Import contact data from Salesforce to Qwary"], "rerank_score": 0.520804}, {"url": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/workflows/salesforce-workflow/map-survey-response-data-into-salesforce/create-event-based-salesforce-workflow", "span": "- Map survey response data into Salesforce Create event-based Salesforce workflow\n\n# Create event-based Salesforce workflow\n\nCreate an event-based workflow in Qwary to map your response data into Zendesk.\n\nCreate event-based workflow\n\n- Create an event-based workflow from Workflow --> Create new workflow --> Enter name --> and click Create.\n\n- Click on Add a Trigger and select the survey you created for \"Create an email campaign for Salesforce Case/Opportunity\"\n\n- Add ''Salesforce - Update a case/opportunity with rating and survey response in SalesForce'' task/\n\n- Connect your Salesforce account", "owner": "crawler", "space": "QWARY_HELP", "title": "Create event-based Salesforce workflow", "doc_id": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/workflows/salesforce-workflow/map-survey-response-data-into-salesforce/create-event-based-salesforce-workflow", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_f0a94739df2d0b95", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "stale", "updated_at": "2023-05-26T14:06:40Z", "fusion_rank": 10, "heading_path": [], "rerank_score": 0.630854}, {"url": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/workflows/salesforce-workflow/import-contact-data-from-salesforce-to-qwary", "span": "- Workflows Salesforce Workflow Create an email campaign for Salesforce Case/Opportunity.\n\n- Import contact data from Salesforce to Qwary\n\n# Import contact data from Salesforce to Qwary\n\nQwary''s Salesforce integration simplifies contact import, making it easy to bring your Salesforce contacts into the Qwary platform for seamless data management.\n\nWith Qwary''s integration, you can effortlessly bring in your new contacts or update existing contacts from Salesforce into the Qwary platform. This streamlined import functionality eliminates the need for manual data entry or complex data migration pr", "owner": "crawler", "space": "QWARY_HELP", "title": "Import contact data from Salesforce to Qwary", "doc_id": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/workflows/salesforce-workflow/import-contact-data-from-salesforce-to-qwary", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_b81f13f029bae226", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "stale", "updated_at": "2023-05-25T15:50:41Z", "fusion_rank": 3, "heading_path": [], "rerank_score": 0.500929}, {"url": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/faq/download-response", "span": "- Move Survey Question\n\n- Download Response\n\n- Enable Partial Submission\n\n- FAQ\n\n# Download Response\n\nExport Surveys Responses in CSV Format\n\n#### 6. Click on highlight\n\nLast updated 3 years ago", "owner": "crawler", "space": "QWARY_HELP", "title": "Download Response", "doc_id": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/faq/download-response", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_8cfc713dea32192c", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "stale", "updated_at": "2023-05-04T20:26:48Z", "fusion_rank": 5, "heading_path": [], "rerank_score": 0.50763}, {"url": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/workflows/zendesk-workflow/map-survey-response-data-into-zendesk/event-based-zendesk-workflow", "span": "- Map survey response data into Zendesk Event-based Zendesk workflow\n\n# Event-based Zendesk workflow\n\nYou can also reuse the workflow created by the \"Send post-resolution email campaign'' or Create an event-based workflow in Qwary to map your response data into Zendesk.\n\nGenerate a token for the Zendesk account\n\n- Log into your Zendesk account and go to ''Admin Center''\n\n- Go to Apps & Integrations --> API --> Zendesk API\n\n- Enable ''Token Access'' --> Click on ''Add API Token''\n\n- Enter the API token description and copy Token Value. Make sure to copy and store this token. We won''t show it again aft", "owner": "crawler", "space": "QWARY_HELP", "title": "Event-based Zendesk workflow", "doc_id": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/workflows/zendesk-workflow/map-survey-response-data-into-zendesk/event-based-zendesk-workflow", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_31fa4c0b2f127b4b", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "stale", "updated_at": "2023-05-26T14:38:17Z", "fusion_rank": 11, "heading_path": [], "rerank_score": 0.538271}, {"url": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/workflows/salesforce-workflow/create-an-email-campaign-for-salesforce-case-opportunity.", "span": "Create an app in Salesforce.\n\nSkip this step if you already have an app created for Qwary.\n\n- Log into the salesforce account.\n\n- Open to Settings --> Setup.\n\n- Go to platform tools --> App Manager & click ''New Connected App.''\n\n- Enter the below information and click on ''Save.''\n\n- After saving your record, Click on consumer details and save the consumer key and secret.\n\nConnect Qwary to Salesforce with scheduler workflow.\n\n- Go to Workflows --> Create new workflow --> Select Schedule-based workflow, enter workflow name, and click ''Create.''\n\n- Click on ''Add Task.'' There are three tasks to selec", "owner": "crawler", "space": "QWARY_HELP", "title": "Create an email campaign for Salesforce Case/Opportunity.", "doc_id": "https://help.qwary.com/product-guide/workflows/salesforce-workflow/create-an-email-campaign-for-salesforce-case-opportunity.", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_44c3aa9f19a65f29", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "stale", "updated_at": "2023-05-25T15:50:41Z", "fusion_rank": 15, "heading_path": ["Create an email campaign for Salesforce Case/Opportunity."], "rerank_score": 0.551287}], "conflicts": [], "followups": [{"because": "the document \u201cSalesforce Workflow\u201d", "question": "What does the documentation say about Salesforce Workflow?"}, {"because": "a section of \u201cImport contact data from Salesforce to Qwary\u201d", "question": "What does the documentation say about Import contact data from Salesforce to Qwary?"}, {"because": "the document \u201cCreate event-based Salesforce workflow\u201d", "question": "What does the documentation say about Create event-based Salesforce workflow?"}, {"because": "the document \u201cDownload Response\u201d", "question": "What does the documentation say about Download Response?"}], "answered_by": {"cited": [1, 2, 3, 6, 8, 12], "model": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "grounded": true, "provider": "langchain"}, "refusal_reason": null}'::jsonb, '[{"name": "compile", "label": "Compiling scope and permissions", "detail": "plan pln_b2fa1043c3b0462e", "status": "ok"}, {"name": "candidates", "label": "Searching the index and the store", "detail": "pgp 20, ecm 20", "status": "ok"}, {"name": "resolve", "label": "Resolving candidates against the store", "detail": "32 candidates, 0 stale, 0 forbidden", "status": "ok"}, {"name": "passages", "label": "Recovering p