-06052027-8651473.1.1", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Wells Fargo Customer Service Contact Us Numbers | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/contact-us", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_f8fc2d36c49be09e", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 2, "heading_path": ["Contact Us", "Find the right contact to get help quickly", "Private Wealth"], "rerank_score": 0.626918}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "span": "Learn more Learn more\n\n### Explore payment options\n\nLet''s go Let''s go\n\n### Call us\n\nHow was your experience? Give us feedback.\n\nAvailability may be affected by your mobile carrier''s coverage area. Your mobile carrier''s message and data rates may apply.\n\nTerms and conditions apply. Mobile carrier''s message and data rates may apply. See Wells Fargo''s Online Access Agreement for more information.\n\nDT1-02272027-12-8832429-1.1", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Auto loans FAQs | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_c31bd36980be52df", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 7, "heading_path": ["Auto loan FAQs", "Additional resources", "Wells Fargo auto loans"], "rerank_score": 0.62733}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "span": "- Auto loan FAQs\n\n## Auto loan Frequently Asked Questions\n\nGet the answers you need about Wells Fargo vehicle financing and servicing.\n\n## Getting started\n\nWells Fargo auto loans are only available through our nationwide network of nearly 11,000 dealerships. Be sure to ask your dealership if Wells Fargo auto financing is available. If your loan is funded by Wells Fargo Auto, we''ll service your account.\n\nWe don''t offer refinancing for auto loans at this time. If you''re experiencing financial challenges, visit Help with auto loan payments to learn what options may be available to you.\n\nStart by ", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Auto loans FAQs | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_3e5e2f7060e2060b", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 7, "heading_path": ["Esta p\u00e1gina solo est\u00e1 disponible en ingl\u00e9s", "Popular FAQs"], "rerank_score": 0.59376}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/credit-cards", "span": "Wells Fargo Rewards offers you a wide variety of ways to earn, use, and share rewards \u2014 from Travel to Gift Cards, and more.\n\nWith a Wells Fargo rewards-based credit card, you can earn rewards on virtually all purchases , including everyday items like groceries or gas, or on bigger items, like when you book travel, or stay at a hotel. Visit Wells Fargo Rewards to learn more.", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Credit Card Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/credit-cards", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_a5d6beb591f798de", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 3, "heading_path": ["Credit Card Help", "Top Questions", "What is Wells Fargo Rewards \u00ae ?"], "rerank_score": 0.568872}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/credit-cards", "span": "Sign on to the Credit Card Service Center through Wells Fargo Online and select Request Balance Transfer under Account Management . Or call 1-800-642-4720 .\n\nRead more about balance transfers .", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Credit Card Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/credit-cards", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_ea8609a5b3d2f6e6", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "f