 to close your Loan, Line of Credit, or other type of account, please call the appropriate customer service department listed on your statement or in this phone directory.\n\n### How do I search for a check?\n\nIf you already have Wells Fargo Online access, sign on . Click Checks from the Account Activity page. Then:\n\n- Use Search to view more transactions\n\n- You must enter either a check number (or range of check numbers) or the dollar amount of the check (or range of dollar amounts) to complete the search for your check.\n\n- View a check by selecting the check icon.\n\nIf you''re no", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Checking and Savings Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/checking-savings", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_4a083f8ce115c472", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 1, "heading_path": ["Checking and Savings Help", "You have questions, we have answers", "How do I close a checking or savings account?"], "rerank_score": 0.688322}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/checking-savings", "span": "- Review your statements for automatic transactions and cancel them by contacting the merchant(s).\n\n- When you have a previously authorized transaction, such as ATM and debit card transactions, account transfers, and Wells Fargo Online Bill Pay transactions presented for payment and your account doesn''t have enough money, we will pay the item(s) into overdraft and an overdraft fee may be assessed . Please refer to the Deposit Account Agreement and Consumer Fee and Information Schedule for more information.\n\n- When checks and preauthorized automatic payments (ACH) are presented for payment and ", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Checking and Savings Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/checking-savings", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_eadc3067a74396e9", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 1, "heading_path": ["Checking and Savings Help", "You have questions, we have answers", "How do I close a checking or savings account?"], "rerank_score": 0.686658}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/checking-savings", "span": "- Prime Checking and Premier Checking accounts that need to process a statement; the statement will be finalized no later than the third business day of the month.\n\n- Legal or bank restrictions that need to be resolved.\n\n- Funds pledged for collateral or other purposes that need to be released.\n\n- Balance sweep feature needs to be removed.\n\n- Overdrawn accounts that need to be brought to a zero or positive balance.\n\n- This information may help you avoid additional transactions and fees: If your account is enrolled in the optional Debit Card Overdraft Service, any account holder with transactio", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Checking and Savings Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/checking-savings", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_7caa43dfa3aa5120", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 1, "heading_path": ["Checking and Savings Help", "You have questions, we have answers", "How do I close a checking or savings account?"], "rerank_score": 0.666072}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "span": "Make your check or money order payable to Wells Fargo Auto. Be sure to fill in all sections of a money order. (Don''t send cash.) Write your account number on your check or money order. Mail your payment to:\n\nWells Fargo Auto PO Box 51963 Los Angeles, CA 90051-6263\n\n- Online bill pay - Your financial institution may offer a bill pay service. Please use your 10-digit Wells Fargo Auto account number and the mailing address Wells Fargo Auto, PO Box 51963, Los Angeles, CA 90051-6263 for the payee information.\n\n- MoneyGram \u00ae - Include your 10-digit Wells Fargo Auto account number and Receive Code 18", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_a3658239c1e57654", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 2, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan Help", "You have questions, we have answers"], "rerank_score": 0.587315}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "span": "You could have a quick credit decision, typically the same day.\n\nFor most applications, you can track your application status online if you share your email address with us at the time of application. We''ll send you an email telling you how.\n\nWith automatic payments, your payment is debited monthly from your checking or savings account. To set up automatic payments, sign on , select your auto loan from Account Summary, and then select Set up Autopay . You can also call us at 1-800-289-8004 or download the automatic loan payments authorization (PDF) , complete the form, and return by mail or fa", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_931ef227c19f432f", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 2, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan Help", "You have questions, we have answers"], "rerank_score": 0.581699}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/investing-and-retirement", "span": "- Not Insured by the FDIC or Any Federal Government Agency\n\n- Not a Deposit or Other Obligation of, or Guaranteed by, the Bank or Any Bank Affiliate\n\n- Subject to Investment Risks, Including Possible Loss of the Principal Amount Invested\n\nInvestment products and services are offered through Wells Fargo Advisors, a trade name used by Wells Fargo Cleari