raft Service, any account holder with transactio", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Checking and Savings Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/checking-savings", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_7caa43dfa3aa5120", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 1, "heading_path": ["Checking and Savings Help", "You have questions, we have answers", "How do I close a checking or savings account?"], "rerank_score": 0.699804}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "span": "Mail\n\n- Make your check or money order payable to Wells Fargo Auto.\n\n- Write \"Payoff\" on the memo line of the check or money order and include your 10-digit account number or 17-digit vehicle identification number (VIN).\n\n- Mail your payoff to: Wells Fargo Auto PO Box 51963 Los Angeles, CA 90051-6263 Mail an overnight payoff to: Lockbox Services 51963 Wells Fargo Auto 3440 Flair Dr. El Monte, CA 91731\n\nUse the following information for a wire transfer and include your 10-digit account number or processing may be delayed.\n\nBank name: Wells Fargo Bank Bank ABA routing # \u2013 domestic: 121000248 Ban", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_98ba04fe82d05df3", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 3, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan Help", "You have questions, we have answers"], "rerank_score": 0.411827}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "span": "If you''d like to change your automatic payment, you''ll need to cancel the recurring schedule and then set up Autopay again. To cancel your automatic payments, sign on , select your auto loan from Account Summary, and then select Manage Autopay . Please allow at least 3 business days before the automatic payment is scheduled to withdraw.\n\nAs an Online Banking customer, you have access to view, download, and print up to 12 months of auto loan statements. If you''d like to stop receiving paper statements in the mail, sign on to your account and select Manage delivery preferences .\n\nBefore you appl", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_a58d027db38525e3", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 3, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan Help", "You have questions, we have answers"], "rerank_score": 0.408197}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "span": "If you change your due date, your loan maturity date will be adjusted. Your monthly payment amount will remain the same.\n\nTo request a due date change, please call us at 1-800-289-8004 .\n\nSign on to your account, select your auto loan from Account Summary, and then Get payoff quote . If your payoff amount is less than $5,000, you can make an online payment to pay off your account.\n\nMail\n\n- Make your check or money order payable to Wells Fargo Auto.\n\n- Write \"Payoff\" on the memo line of the check or money order and include your 10-digit account number or 17-digit vehicle identification number (", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_f221a3b81def3465", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 3, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan Help", "You have questions, we have answers"], "rerank_score": 0.397937}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/routing-number", "span": "Your account number is located along the bottom of your check, to the right of the routing number and to the left of the check number.\n\n## Routing number\n\nDon''t know your account number? Call us at 1-800-869-3557 , 24 hours a day, 7 days a week.", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Routing & Account Number Information for Your Wells Fargo Accounts", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/routing-number", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_f4ba462601f84472", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 2, "heading_path": ["Routing Numbers and Account Numbers", "Look at a check"], "rerank_score": 0.382783}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/routing-number", "span": "Your routing number is:\n\nNote for California customers: If you opened your account in Southern California, you may see a different routing number on your checks than the number displayed above. You can use either number.\n\nNote for California customers: If your account has check-writing capabilities and you opened the account in Southern California, you may see a different routing number on your checks than the number displayed above. You can use either number.", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Routing & Account Number Information for Your Wells Fargo Accounts", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/routing-number", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_c7d50bbec6e7e207", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 2, "heading_path": ["Routing Numbers and Account Numbers", "Routing number Direct Deposit instructions"], "rerank_score": 0.373552}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "span": "Online Sign on , select your auto loan from Account Summary, and then Get payoff quote .\n\nAccount statement View your payoff amount and daily interest on your monthly account statement.\n\nPhone Call us at 1-800-289-8004 to get an automated payoff quote or to speak to a representative.\n\nIf you choose to pay off your account after the date provided, please call us for an updated quote.\n\nWhen preparing to pay off your loan:\n\n- Discontinue automatic payments or bill pay transfers at least 3 business days prior to payoff.\n\n- Consider paying with certified funds, such as a cashier\u2019s check or money or", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Auto loans FAQs | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_6f51316e1f4b3504", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 12, "heading_path": ["Auto loan FAQs", "Auto loan payoff"], "rerank_score": 0.419654}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/credit-cards", "span": "How do I report a lost or stolen card? If your credit card is lost or stolen, report it immediately to our 24-hour Customer Service number, 1-800-642-4720 or sign on and go to Replace my card . If you have fraudulent transactions we will need to speak to you.\n\nPlease note: When you report your credit card as lost or stolen, you will receive a new card with a new account number. If you believe you have misplaced your card, you can temporarily turn your card off by signing on and going to Card Controls.\n\nTurning off your card is not a replacement for reporting your card lost or stolen. Contact u", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Credit Card Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/credit-cards", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_2b08f6192d6f62ef", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 5, "heading_path": ["Credit Card Help", "Top Questions"], "rerank_score": 0.387619}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/credit-cards", "span": "- You need to destroy any unused SUPERCHECKS associated with the lost or stolen card, because they will no longer be valid.\n\n- When you report a card lost or stolen, we won\u2019t process any pending SUPERCHECKS associated with the account.\n\n- If your card is lost or stolen, we won\u2019t reissue new SUPERCHECKS. You can still transfer balances online or over the phone.", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Credit Card Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/credit-cards", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_1767b148b9b57e9d", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 5, "heading_path": ["Credit Card Help", "Top Questions", "What happens to my balance transfer SUPERCHECKS TM if my card is lost or stolen?"], "rerank_score": 0.377223}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/contact-us", "span": "- Contact Us\n\n## Find the right contact to get help quickly\n\nIf you suspect fraud on your account, contact us immediately\n\nSchedule an appointment online to meet 1:1 with a banker.\n\n### Debit Cards\n\n1-800-869-3557\n\nDebit FAQs", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Wells Fargo Customer Service Contact Us Numbers | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/contact-us", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_5e5853007aa005b4", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 9, "heading_path": ["Esta p\u00e1gina solo est\u00e1 disponible en ingl\u00e9s", "Popular FAQs"], "rerank_score": 0.389249}], "conflicts": [], "followups": [{"because": "a section of \u201cChecking and Savings Help | Wells Fargo\u201d", "question": "What does the documentation say about You have questions, we have answers?"}, {"because": "the document \u201cChecking and Savings Help | Wells Fargo\u201d", "question": "What does the documentation say about Checking and Savings Help | Wells Fargo?"}, {"because": "the document \u201cPersonal Loan Help | Wells Fargo\u201d", "question": "What does the documentation say about Personal Loan Help | Wells Fargo?"}, {"because": "a section of \u201cRouting & Account Number Infor