 Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/credit-cards/credit-card-faqs", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_0f1fc0b23a46c72d", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 1, "heading_path": ["Credit Card FAQs", "Credit Cards"], "rerank_score": 0.28919}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/online-banking", "span": "Online Troubleshooting\n\nLanguage Preference FAQs\n\n### Applications and Rates\n\nLearn how our mobile app can make banking easier while you\u2019re on the go\n\nDownload the app >\n\nInvestment and Insurance Products are:\n\n- Not Insured by the FDIC or Any Federal Government Agency\n\n- Not a Deposit or Other Obligation of, or Guaranteed by, the Bank or Any Bank Affiliate\n\n- Subject to Investment Risks, Including Possible Loss of the Principal Amount Invested\n\nInvestment products and services are offered through Wells Fargo Advisors. Wells Fargo Advisors is a trade name used by Wells Fargo Clearing Services,", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Online Banking Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/online-banking", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_3fdffaf112d2b839", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 9, "heading_path": ["Online Banking Help", "You have questions, we have answers", "More Information"], "rerank_score": 0.360362}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/online-banking", "span": "Mobile app:\n\nDesktop:\n\nMobile (browser):\n\nMicrosoft Edge\n\nFirefox for Windows\n\nGoogle Chrome\n\n### More Information\n\nOnline Troubleshooting\n\nLanguage Preference FAQs\n\n### Top Questions\n\nEnroll now .\n\n### More Information\n\nProfile FAQs\n\nAdvanced Access FAQs", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Online Banking Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/online-banking", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_dc60a611be0d827d", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 9, "heading_path": ["Online Banking Help", "You have questions, we have answers", "Top Questions"], "rerank_score": 0.360131}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/checking-savings", "span": "The fee period is used to calculate the monthly service fee and other monthly fees.\n\nThe dates of previous periods and activities that counted towards avoiding the monthly service fee can be viewed in the Monthly Service Fee Summary (not available for Prime Checking, Premier Checking, retirement, IOLTA, RETA, and analyzed business accounts).\n\nThe summary for each fee period includes:\n\n- Minimum requirements for each option to avoid the monthly service fee\n\n- Your activity towards those requirements within the dates of the fee period\n\nThis information is located on your checking account stateme", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Checking and Savings Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/checking-savings", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_193f2fa031d84094", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 8, "heading_path": ["Checking and Savings Help", "You have questions, we have answers", "What is a fee period?"], "rerank_score": 0.296626}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "span": "You could have a quick credit decision, typically the same day.\n\nFor most applications, you can track your application status online if you share your email address with us at the time of application. We''ll send you an email telling you how.\n\nWith automatic payments, your payment is debited monthly from your checking or savings account. To set up automatic payments, sign on , select your auto loan from Account Summary, and then select Set up Autopay . You can also call us at 1-800-289-8004 or download the automatic loan payments authorization (PDF) , complete the form, and return by mail or fa", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_92eba10ff48214be", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 6, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan Help", "You have questions, we have answers"], "rerank_score": 0.287908}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help", "span": "- Wells Fargo Customer Service\n\n## Connect to information and support\n\nGet info >\n\nGet info >\n\nGet info >\n\nGet info >\n\nGet info >\n\nGet info >\n\nGet info >\n\nGet info >\n\n## Just ask Fargo \u00ae\n\nYour virtual assistant in the mobile app is always ready to help. Get answers, insights, and shortcuts with Fargo .\n\n- Show me my Amazon purchases.\n\n- What\u2019s my routing number?\n\n- Do I have any pending transactions?", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Customer Service \u2013 Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_b35a88906cf2952e", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 13, "heading_path": ["Esta p\u00e1gina solo est\u00e1 disponible en ingl\u00e9s", "Popular FAQs"], "rerank_score": 0.325475}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "span": "Learn more Learn more\n\n### Explore payment options\n\nLet''s go Let''s go\n\n### Call us\n\nHow was your experience? Give us feedback.\n\nAvailability may be affected by your mobile carrier''s coverage area. Your mobile carrier''s message and data rates may apply.\n\nTerms and conditions apply. Mobile carrier''s message and data rates may apply. See Wells Fargo''s Online Access Agreement for more information.\n\nDT1-02272027-12-8832429-1.1", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Auto loans FAQs | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_c31bd36980be52df", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 11, "heading_path": ["Auto loan FAQs", "Additional resources", "Wells Fargo auto loans"], "rerank_score": 0.291431}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/contact-us", "span": "- Contact Us\n\n## Find the right contact to get help quickly\n\nIf you suspect fraud on your account, contact us immediately\n\nSchedule an appointment online to meet 1:1 with a banker.\n\n### Debit Cards\n\n1-800-869-3557\n\nDebit FAQs", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Wells Fargo Customer Service Contact Us Numbers | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/contact-us", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_5e5853007aa005b4", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 15, "heading_path": ["Esta p\u00e1gina solo est\u00e1 disponible en ingl\u00e9s", "Popular FAQs"], "rerank_score": 0.298384}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/checking-savings", "span": "QSR-12172026-8084652.1.1\n\n### Call Us\n\nGive Us Feedback", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Checking and Savings Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/checking-savings", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_44ae0fb27870a4c2", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 8, "heading_path": ["Checking and Savings Help", "Applications and Rates"], "rerank_score": 0.286338}], "conflicts": [], "followups": [{"because": "a section of \u201cInvesting and Retirement Help | Wells Fargo\u201d", "question": "What does the documentation say about Call Us?"}, {"because": "the document \u201cInvesting and Retirement Help | Wells Fargo\u201d", "question": "What does the documentation say about Investing and Retirement Help | Wells Far