our card is not a replacement for reporting your card lost or stolen. Contact u", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Credit Card Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/credit-cards", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_2b08f6192d6f62ef", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 2, "heading_path": ["Credit Card Help", "Top Questions"], "rerank_score": 0.587158}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/contact-us", "span": "- Contact Us\n\n## Find the right contact to get help quickly\n\nIf you suspect fraud on your account, contact us immediately\n\nSchedule an appointment online to meet 1:1 with a banker.\n\n### Debit Cards\n\n1-800-869-3557\n\nDebit FAQs", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Wells Fargo Customer Service Contact Us Numbers | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/contact-us", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_5e5853007aa005b4", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 1, "heading_path": ["Esta p\u00e1gina solo est\u00e1 disponible en ingl\u00e9s", "Popular FAQs"], "rerank_score": 0.535319}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/credit-cards/credit-card-faqs", "span": "If your credit card is lost or stolen, report it immediately to our 24-hour Customer Service number, 1-800-642-4720 or sign on and go to Replace my card . If you have fraudulent transactions we will need to speak to you.\n\nPlease note: When you report your credit card as lost or stolen, you will receive a new card with a new account number. If you believe you have misplaced your card, you can temporarily turn your card off by signing on and going to Card Controls.\n\nTurning off your card is not a replacement for reporting your card lost or stolen. Contact us immediately if you believe that unaut", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Credit Card Questions - Increase Credit Limits - Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/credit-cards/credit-card-faqs", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_339c9c83d02c01de", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 3, "heading_path": ["Credit Card FAQs", "What should I expect after I apply online?", "How do I report a lost or stolen card?"], "rerank_score": 0.551683}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/credit-cards", "span": "You\u2019ll need to continue to make payments as usual except for amounts in dispute. If you\u2019re enrolled in automatic payment or Overdraft Protection, these services may be temporarily unavailable for up to 72 hours while we set up your new account.", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Credit Card Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/credit-cards", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_5e8730e76fef1412", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 2, "heading_path": ["Credit Card Help", "Top Questions", "What should I do about payments if my card is lost or stolen?"], "rerank_score": 0.518944}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/credit-cards/credit-card-faqs", "span": "To request a credit limit increase, please call the number on the back of your card or on your statement.\n\n### What if I have a dispute on my credit card?\n\nTo initiate a dispute please call 1-800-642-4720 or sign on to Wells Fargo Online and access Track Claims in Account Services. Once you contact us, we''ll help resolve your claim as quickly and easily as possible. For questions about a dispute you have already filed, please call 1-800-390-0533 .\n\nIt is important that you understand the merchant\u2019s terms and conditions upon engaging in a transaction with any merchant, whether the transaction i", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Credit Card Questions - Increase Credit Limits - Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/credit-cards/credit-card-faqs", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_f4289ac3a0636dce", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 3, "heading_path": ["Credit Card FAQs", "What should I expect after I apply online?", "How do I increase my credit line?"], "rerank_score": 0.528086}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/checking-savings", "span": "If you find a suspicious card transaction, call the number on the back of your card immediately. Your card comes with Zero Liability protection which means you will be reimbursed for promptly reported unauthorized card transactions, subject to certain conditions. We will investigate your claim. Please refer to the appropriate card terms and conditions for details regarding your responsibility to notify us of disputes within specific time frames. After reporting the suspicious transaction to us, you can track the status online by signing on and going to Dispute a Transaction under the Accounts ", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Checking and Savings Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/checking-savings", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_c06d7ecc01a96b5e", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 5, "heading_path": ["Checking and Savings Help", "You have questions, we have answers", "What do I do if I find a suspicious transaction on my account?"], "rerank_score": 0.518877}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/checking-savings", "span": "Contact us right away when your card is lost or stolen.\n\nSign on to Wells Fargo Online \u00ae to request a replacement card.\n\nOr call us at 1-800-TO-WELLS ( 1-800-869-3557 ) for personal debit or ATM cards.\n\nFor business debit or ATM cards call 1-800-CALL-WELLS ( 1-800-225-5935 ).\n\nNote: If you lose your card while traveling outside the United States, you have two options:\n\n- Call us collect, then follow the voice instructions: If you lose your personal card: 1-925-825-7600\n\n- If you lose your business card: 1-916-480-3190\n\n- Find international access codes to use to contact our toll-free customer ", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Checking and Savings Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/checking-savings", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_5df1ddc035ba2e19", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 5, "heading_path": ["Checking and Savings Help", "You have questions, we have answers", "How do I report a lost or stolen debit or ATM card?"], "rerank_score": 0.506702}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/checking-savings", "span": "If you have misplaced your card and need time to find it, you can temporarily turn your card off to help prevent unauthorized card transactions. Please note that previously authorized recurring payments, credits, refunds, and reversals may be approved while your card is turned off.\n\nWhen you find your card, you can turn it back on. Sign on to Wells Fargo Online or your Wells Fargo Mobile \u00ae app to access Turn Card On or Off .\n\nYou can also call us at 1-800-TO-WELLS ( 1-800-869-3557 ) for personal debit cards. For business debit cards call 1-800-CALL-WELLS ( 1-800-225-5935 ).\n\nIf you think your ", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Checking and Savings Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/checking-savings", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_65fecd5601fbb108", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 5, "heading_path": ["Checking and Savings Help", "You have questions, we have answers", "How do I turn my card on or off?"], "rerank_score": 0.477211}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "span": "You could have a quick credit decision, typically the same day.\n\nFor most applications, you can track your application status online if you share your email address with us at the time of application. We''ll send you an email telling you how.\n\nWith automatic payments, your payment is debited monthly from your checking or savings account. To set up automatic payments, sign on , select your auto loan from Account Summary, and then select Set up Autopay . You can also call us at 1-800-289-8004 or download the automatic loan payments authorization (PDF) , complete the form, and return by mail or fa", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_931ef227c19f432f", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 6, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan Help", "You have questions, we have answers"], "rerank_score": 0.39128}], "conflicts": [], "followups": [{"because": "a section of \u201cWells Fargo Customer Service Contact Us Numbers | Wells Fargo\u201d", "question": "What should I know about Credit Cards?"}, {"because": "the document \u201cWells Fargo Customer Service Contact Us Numbers | Wells Fargo\u201d", "question": "What should I know about Wells Fargo Customer Service Contact Us Numbers?"}, {"because": "the document \u201cCredit Card Questions - Increase Credit Limits - Wells Fargo\u201d", "question": "What should I know about Credit Card Questions - Increase Credit Limits - Wells Fargo?"}, {"because": "a section of \u201cCredit Card Help | Wells Fargo\u201d", "question": "What should I know about Call Us?"}], "answered_by": {"cited": [1, 4, 6], "model": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "grounded": true, "provider": "langchain"}, "refusal_reason": null}'::jsonb, '[{"name": "compile", "label": "Compiling scope and permissions", "detail": "plan pln_8115dba36d4304b3", "status": "ok"}, {"name": "candidates", "label": "Searching the index and the store", "detail": "pgp 16, ecm 4", "status": "ok"}, {"name": "resolve", "label": "Resolving candidates against the store", "detail": "16 candidates, 0 stale, 0 forbidden", "status": "ok"}, {"name": "passages", "label": "Recovering passages", "detail": "cache 100%", "status": "ok"}, {"name": "rerank", "label": "Reranking", "detail": "12 passages above the floor", "status": "ok"}, {"name": "answer", "label": "Composing a grounded answer", "detail": "cited 3 of 12 passages", "status": "ok"}]'::jsonb, true, NULL, '{"cited": [1, 4, 6], "model": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "grounded": true, "provider": "langchain"}'::jsonb, 4334, NULL, '2026-08-24 02:38:33.608172+00:00', '2026-08-24 02:38:33.608172+00:00');
INSERT INTO "aai"."askcontent_chat_turn" ("id", "org_id", "thread_id", "ordinal", "question", "answer", "evidence", "steps", "grounded", "unsupported_reason", "answered_by", "elapsed_ms", "error", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('68fdb962-690d-468c-9057-5d12c0cf8c1e', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', 'ff987c17-f718-4121-b094-2ee1d4152414', 1, 'Can you tell me process about the auto loan process/', 'The passages provide information about managing an auto loan with Wells Fargo, including application tracking, setting up automatic payments, obtaining payoff quotes, and title release after payoff. Here are the main processes described:

## Applying for an Auto Loan

- You can receive a quick credit decision, typically the same day[1][2].
- For most applications, you can track your application status online if you provide your email address at the time of application; Wells Fargo will send you an email with instructions on how to do this[1][2][7][8].

## Setting Up Automatic Payments

To set up automatic payments for your auto loan:

1. Sign on to your Wells Fargo account[1][2].
2. Select your auto loan from **Account Summary**[1][2].
3. Select **Set up Autopay**[1][2].
4. Alternatively, you can call 1-800-289-8004 or download the automatic loan payments authorization (PDF), complete it, and return it by mail or fax[1][2].

- With automatic payments, your payment is debited monthly from your checking or savings account[1][2].

## Changing or Cancelling Automatic Payments

- To change your automatic payment, you must cancel the recurring schedule and set up Autopay again[4].
- To cancel automatic payments:
  1. Sign on to your account[4].
  2. Select your auto loan from **Account Summary**[4].
  3. Select **Manage Autopay**[4].
- Allow at least 3 business days before the automatic payment is scheduled to withdraw[4].

## Viewing Statements

- As an Online Banking customer, you can view, download, and print up to 12 months of auto loan statements[4].
- To stop receiving paper statements, sign on and select **Manage delivery preferences**[4].

## Getting a Payoff Quote

You can obtain your auto loan payoff quote in several ways:

- Online: Sign on, select your auto loan from **Account Summary**, and then select **Get payoff quote**[6].
- Account statement: View your payoff amount and daily interest on your monthly account statement[6].
- Phone: Call 1-800-289-8004 for an automated payoff quote or to speak to a representative[6].

- If you pay off your account after the date provided in the quote, call for an updated quote[6].
- Discontinue automatic payments or bill pay transfers at least 3 business days prior to payoff[6].
- Consider paying with certified funds, such as a cashier’s check or money order[6].

## Title Release After Payoff

- Wells Fargo will begin the title release process within 3 calendar days if the loan is paid off by certain methods, including ACH, bank official check, cash, cashier''s check, money order, and others listed in the passage[5].

## Additional Information

- Your contract contains information about late fees, finance charges, and other fees or charges that may apply to your loan account. For a copy, call 1-800-289-8004[3].
- For title-related questions, call 1-888-329-4856[5].

