oans", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_931ef227c19f432f", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 1, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan Help", "You have questions, we have answers"], "rerank_score": 0.603385}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "span": "You could have a quick credit decision, typically the same day.\n\nFor most applications, you can track your application status online if you share your email address with us at the time of application. We''ll send you an email telling you how.\n\nWith automatic payments, your payment is debited monthly from your checking or savings account. To set up automatic payments, sign on , select your auto loan from Account Summary, and then select Set up Autopay . You can also call us at 1-800-289-8004 or download the automatic loan payments authorization (PDF) , complete the form, and return by mail or fa", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_92eba10ff48214be", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 1, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan Help", "You have questions, we have answers"], "rerank_score": 0.598872}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "span": "Starting with tax year 2026, an IRS tax form (Form 1098-VLI) will be sent to customers with a qualified passenger vehicle that may be eligible for a tax deduction.\n\nYou can find the total interest paid on your loan for the previous year on your January, February, and March monthly statements or you can call us to request an interest paid statement.\n\nYour contract has information about late fees, finance charges, and other fees or charges that may apply to your loan account. If you need a copy of your contract, please call us at 1-800-289-8004 .\n\nNote: Fees may apply for payments made through t", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Auto loans FAQs | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_ef803f3f77fc1f03", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 2, "heading_path": ["Auto loan FAQs", "Understanding your auto loan"], "rerank_score": 0.58493}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "span": "If you''d like to change your automatic payment, you''ll need to cancel the recurring schedule and then set up Autopay again. To cancel your automatic payments, sign on , select your auto loan from Account Summary, and then select Manage Autopay . Please allow at least 3 business days before the automatic payment is scheduled to withdraw.\n\nAs an Online Banking customer, you have access to view, download, and print up to 12 months of auto loan statements. If you''d like to stop receiving paper statements in the mail, sign on to your account and select Manage delivery preferences .\n\nBefore you appl", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_a58d027db38525e3", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 1, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan Help", "You have questions, we have answers"], "rerank_score": 0.582644}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "span": "If you have additional title-related questions, please call us at 1-888-329-4856 , Monday \u2013 Friday, 7 am to 8 pm, and Saturday, 7 am to 5:30 pm Central Time.\n\nWe''ll begin the title release process within 3 calendar days if paid off by:\n\n- ACH (Automated Clearing House)\n\n- Bank official check\n\n- Cash\n\n- Cashier''s check\n\n- Enterprise Car Sales dealers\n\n- Franchised dealer check\n\n- Money order\n\n- MoneyGram\n\n- State and local government check (Wells Fargo Auto doesn''t accept second endorsements; check must be payable to Wells Fargo Auto.)\n\n- Traveler\u2019s check\n\n- U.S. treasury check (Wells Fargo Aut", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Auto loans FAQs | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_1f7debf058361d57", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 2, "heading_path": ["Auto loan FAQs", "Title and registration"], "rerank_score": 0.584025}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "span": "Online Sign on , select your auto loan from Account Summary, and then Get payoff quote .\n\nAccount statement View your payoff amount and daily interest on your monthly account statement.\n\nPhone Call us at 1-800-289-8004 to get an automated payoff quote or to speak to a representative.\n\nIf you choose to pay off your account after the date provided, please call us for an updated quote.\n\nWhen preparing to pay off your loan:\n\n- Discontinue automatic payments or bill pay transfers at least 3 business days prior to payoff.\n\n- Consider paying with certified funds, such as a cashier\u2019s check or money or", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Auto loans FAQs | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_6f51316e1f4b3504", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 2, "heading_path": ["Auto loan FAQs", "Auto loan payoff"], "rerank_score": 0.579923}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/personal-loan-faqs/?sub_channel=WEB&vendor_code=WF&linkloc=FNPLFAQ", "span": "For most applications, you can track your application status online if you share your email address with us at the time of application. We''ll send you an email telling you how.\n\nFor most applications, you can track your application status online if you share your email address with us at the time of application. We''ll send you an email telling you how.\n\n- Call us to pay by phone 1-877-269-6056 Monday \u2013 Friday 7:00 am \u2013 7:00 pm Central Time\n\n- Mail your payment in U.S. dollars payable to Wells Fargo Bank, N.A. Mailed payments must be in the form of a personal check, cashier\u2019s check or money ord", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan FAQs \u2013 Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/personal-loan-faqs/?sub_channel=WEB&vendor_code=WF&linkloc=FNPLFAQ", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_ca038359d118b417", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 3, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan FAQs", "Loan Decisioning Process"], "rerank_score": 0.539015}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/personal-loan-faqs/?sub_channel=WEB&vendor_code=WF&linkloc=FNPLFAQ", "span": "You may also:\n\nFor most applications, you can track your application status online if you share your email address with us at the time of application. We''ll send you an email telling you how.", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan FAQs \u2013 Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/personal-loan-faqs/?sub_channel=WEB&vendor_code=WF&linkloc=FNPLFAQ", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_ad8916d75a097c99", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 3, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan FAQs", "Application"], "rerank_score": 0.49465}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/contact-us", "span": "Auto Loans FAQs >\n\n### Personal Loans\n\nPersonal Loan FAQs >\n\nServicing:\n\n### Wells Fargo Advisors Full Service Brokerage\n\nNew Customers\n\nHow Do I...\n\n### WellsTrade \u00ae Online Brokerage\n\nNew Customers\n\nHow Do I...\n\n### Intuitive Investor \u00ae\n\nNew Customers", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Wells Fargo Customer Service Contact Us Numbers | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/contact-us", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_50af1f453575b900", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 5, "heading_path": ["Contact Us", "Find the right contact to get help quickly", "Auto Loans"], "rerank_score": 0.529653}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/home-lending", "span": "How can I start my mortgage application? Get started through any of these convenient ways:\n\nGet prequalified\n\nYou can more confidently search for homes with a Wells Fargo prequalification, which shows sellers you\u2019re a serious buyer and gives you a better idea of your potential loan amount, monthly payment, and interest rate.\n\n- Get prequalified\n\nApply online\n\nOur simplified and secure online mortgage application will walk you through the process step by step. If you\u2019re a Wells Fargo customer and use your Wells Fargo Online \u00ae username and password at the start of your application . To determine", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Home Lending Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/home-lending", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_559184d67232273e", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 4, "heading_path": ["Home Lending Help", "Top Questions"], "rerank_score": 0.452463}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/home-lending", "span": "- Call 1-877-937-9357\n\n- Get a call back\n\n- Find a local consultant\n\n### Does Wells Fargo require a property inspection?\n\nIf you''re buying a home, it''s highly recommended that you obtain a property inspection and make your purchase offer contingent on the findings of the inspection.\n\nThere is a difference between a property inspection and an appraisal. An appraisal is required by most mortgage lenders in order to support the value of the real estate and the terms of the mortgage agreement.", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Home Lending Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/home-lending", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_433bea05168e0062", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 4, "heading_path": ["Home Lending Help", "Top Questions"], "rerank_score": 0.392298}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/home-lending", "span": "- VA loans offer low- and no-down-payment options for eligible veterans and other eligible borrowers. Up to 100% financing may be available on VA loans for qualified borrowers.\n\n### Can I make a mortgage payment online?\n\nYes, you can make a payment and manage your mortgage account online, anytime. Gain instant access to your mortgage account details, loan history, tax and interest data, contact information updates, and more. It''s fast and simple. Get more details", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Home Lending Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/home-lending", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_cb8e6eb60c7fb873", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 4, "heading_path": ["Home Lending Help", "Top Questions", "What is the minimum down payment for conventional, FHA, and VA loans?"], "rerank_score": 0.364963}], "conflicts": [], "followups": [{"because": "a section of \u201cPersonal Loan Help | Wells Fargo\u201d", "question": "What should I know about You have questions, we have answers?"}, {"because": "the document \u201cPersonal Loan Help | Wells Fargo\u201d", "question": "What should I know about Personal Loan Help?"}, {"because": "a section of \u201cAuto loans FAQs | Wells Fargo\u201d", "question": "What should I kno