ttps://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "span": "You could have a quick credit decision, typically the same day.\n\nFor most applications, you can track your application status online if you share your email address with us at the time of application. We''ll send you an email telling you how.\n\nWith automatic payments, your payment is debited monthly from your checking or savings account. To set up automatic payments, sign on , select your auto loan from Account Summary, and then select Set up Autopay . You can also call us at 1-800-289-8004 or download the automatic loan payments authorization (PDF) , complete the form, and return by mail or fa", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_92eba10ff48214be", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 1, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan Help", "You have questions, we have answers"], "rerank_score": 0.508656}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/personal-loan-faqs/?sub_channel=WEB&vendor_code=WF&linkloc=FNPLFAQ", "span": "Representative example of repayment terms for an unsecured personal loan: For $17,000 borrowed over 48 months at 13.99% Annual Percentage Rate (APR), the monthly payment is $464. This example is an estimate only and assumes all payments are made on time.\n\nBefore you apply, we encourage you to carefully consider whether consolidating your existing debt is the right choice for you. Consolidating multiple debts means you will have a single payment monthly, but it may not reduce or pay your debt off sooner. The payment reduction may come from a lower interest rate, a longer loan term, or a combina", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan FAQs \u2013 Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/personal-loan-faqs/?sub_channel=WEB&vendor_code=WF&linkloc=FNPLFAQ", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_b4bc5c8f8b9ac65c", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 2, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan FAQs", "How can we help?"], "rerank_score": 0.583045}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/personal-loan-faqs/?sub_channel=WEB&vendor_code=WF&linkloc=FNPLFAQ", "span": "Deposit products offered by Wells Fargo Bank, N.A. Member FDIC.", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan FAQs \u2013 Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/personal-loan-faqs/?sub_channel=WEB&vendor_code=WF&linkloc=FNPLFAQ", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_8f12f9eac6fac04f", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 2, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan FAQs", "How can we help?"], "rerank_score": 0.505082}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "span": "If you''d like to change your automatic payment, you''ll need to cancel the recurring schedule and then set up Autopay again. To cancel your automatic payments, sign on , select your auto loan from Account Summary, and then select Manage Autopay . Please allow at least 3 business days before the automatic payment is scheduled to withdraw.\n\nAs an Online Banking customer, you have access to view, download, and print up to 12 months of auto loan statements. If you''d like to stop receiving paper statements in the mail, sign on to your account and select Manage delivery preferences .\n\nBefore you appl", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_a58d027db38525e3", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 1, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan Help", "You have questions, we have answers"], "rerank_score": 0.497388}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/personal-loan-faqs/?sub_channel=WEB&vendor_code=WF&linkloc=FNPLFAQ", "span": "You may also:\n\nFor most applications, you can track your application status online if you share your email address with us at the time of application. We''ll send you an email telling you how.", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan FAQs \u2013 Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/personal-loan-faqs/?sub_channel=WEB&vendor_code=WF&linkloc=FNPLFAQ", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_ad8916d75a097c99", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 2, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan FAQs", "Application"], "rerank_score": 0.504798}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "span": "The amount of interest paid each month changes because the daily interest amount decreases as the principal balance decreases.\n\nAt the beginning of the loan, the principal balance is higher, and as a result, the daily interest amount is higher. As you start paying down your principal balance, the amount of interest you pay each month decreases.\n\nIn addition, interest accrues daily, and the number of days between payments makes a difference. More days between payments results in more days of interest charges, and fewer days between payments results in fewer days of interest charges.\n\nA tax bene", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Auto loans FAQs | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_17c70c3fe3b82dec", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 5, "heading_path": ["Auto loan FAQs", "Understanding your auto loan"], "rerank_score": 0.436876}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "span": "Starting with tax year 2026, an IRS tax form (Form 1098-VLI) will be sent to customers with a qualified passenger vehicle that may be eligible for a tax deduction.\n\nYou can find the total interest paid on your loan for the previous year on your January, February, and March monthly statements or you can call us to request an interest paid statement.\n\nYour contract has information about late fees, finance charges, and other fees or charges that may apply to your loan account. If you need a copy of your contract, please call us at 1-800-289-8004 .\n\nNote: Fees may apply for payments made through t", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Auto loans FAQs | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_ef803f3f77fc1f03", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 5, "heading_path": ["Auto loan FAQs", "Understanding your auto loan"], "rerank_score": 0.429312}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/home-lending", "span": "How can I start my mortgage application? Get started through any of these convenient ways:\n\nGet prequalified\n\nYou can more confidently search for homes with a Wells Fargo prequalification, which shows sellers you\u2019re a serious buyer and gives you a better idea of your potential loan amount, monthly payment, and interest rate.\n\n- Get prequalified\n\nApply online\n\nOur simplified and secure online mortgage application will walk you through the process step by step. If you\u2019re a Wells Fargo customer and use your Wells Fargo Online \u00ae username and password at the start of your application . To determine", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Home Lending Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/home-lending", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_559184d67232273e", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 3, "heading_path": ["Home Lending Help", "Top Questions"], "rerank_score": 0.416646}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/home-lending", "span": "- Call 1-877-937-9357\n\n- Get a call back\n\n- Find a local consultant\n\n### Does Wells Fargo require a property inspection?\n\nIf you''re buying a home, it''s highly recommended that you obtain a property inspection and make your purchase offer contingent on the findings of the inspection.\n\nThere is a difference between a property inspection and an appraisal. An appraisal is required by most mortgage lenders in order to support the value of the real estate and the terms of the mortgage agreement.", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Home Lending Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/home-lending", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_433bea05168e0062", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 3, "heading_path": ["Home Lending Help", "Top Questions"], "rerank_score": 0.414928}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "span": "Grace periods vary from state to state, so please review your loan contract for information about the grace period and late fees. If you''re unable to find your loan contract, please call us for more information or to request a copy.\n\nIf your payment is 30 or more days late, it may show up on your credit report as a late payment. The degree to which a late payment affects your credit score can depend on things like how many days past due the payment is, how recently you''ve been past due, and how frequently you\u2019ve made late payments.\n\nReview your credit report so you know where you stand. Free c", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Auto loans FAQs | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_ec0d43d9d4dc37ca", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 5, "heading_path": ["Auto loan FAQs", "Payment challenges"], "rerank_score": 0.425747}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/home-lending", "span": "We can help you understand your options if you are facing payment challenges. Call 1-800-678-7986 .\n\n## Tools and Calculators\n\n- Get prequalified\n\n### Call Us\n\nGive Us Feedback", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Home Lending Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/home-lending", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_d0c1752e51064f66", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 3, "heading_path": ["Home Lending Help", "Top Questions", "Who do I contact if I am having trouble paying my mortgage?"], "rerank_score": 0.405248}], "conflicts": [{"subject": "annual borrowed example loan (currency)", "citations": [{"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "span": "Representative example of repayment terms for an unsecured personal loan: For $17,000 borrowed over 48 months at 13.99% Annual Percentage Rate (APR), the monthly payment is $464. This example is an estimate only and assumes all payments are made on time.", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_4c0381b4574ae872", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 1, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan Help", "How can we help?"], "rerank_score": 0.585389}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/personal-loan-faqs/?sub_channel=WEB&vendor_code=WF&linkloc=FNPLFAQ", "span": "Representative example of repayment terms for an unsecured personal loan: For $17,000 borrowed over 48 months at 13.99% Annual Percentage Rate (APR), the monthly payment is $464. This example is an estimate only and assumes all payments are made on time.\n\nBefore you apply, we encourage you to carefully consider whether consolidating your existing debt is the right choice for you. Consolidating multiple debts means you will have a single payment monthly, but it may not reduce or pay your debt off sooner. The payment reduction may come from a lower interest rate, a longer loan term, or a combina", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan FAQs \u2013 Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/personal-loan-faqs/?sub_channel=WEB&vendor_code=WF&linkloc=FNPLFAQ", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_b4bc5c8f8b9ac65c", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 2, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan FAQs", "How can we help?"], "rerank_score": 0.583045}]}], "followups": [{"because": "a section of \u201cPersonal Loan Help | Wells Fargo\u201d", "question": "How can we help?"}, {"because": "a section of \u201cPersonal Loan Help | Wells Fargo\u201d", "question": "What should I know about You have questions, we have answers?"}, {"because": "the document \u201cPersonal Loan FAQs \u2013 Wells Fargo\u201d", "question": "What do people usually ask about Personal Loan?"}, {"because": "a section of \u201cPersonal Loan FAQs \u2013 Wells Fargo\u201d", "question": "What should I know about Application?"}], "answered_by": {"cited": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6], "model": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "grounded": true, "provider": "langchain"}, "refusal_reason": null}'::jsonb, '[{"name": "compile", "label": "Compiling scope and permissions", "detail": "plan pln_71b947587e736201", "status": "ok"}, {"name": "candidates", "label": "Searching the index and the store", "detail": "pgp 16, ecm 10", "status": "ok"}, {"name": "resolve", "label": "Resolving candidates against the store", "detail": "16 candidates, 0 stale, 0 forbidden", "status": "ok"}, {"name": "passages", "label": "Recovering passages", "detail": "cache 100%", "status": "ok"}, {"name": "rerank", "label": "Reranking", "detail"