formation for Your Wells Fargo Accounts", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/routing-number", "authority": "supporting", "cache_hit": true, "staleness": "unknown_age", "dropped_by": null, "parse_path": "html_trafilatura", "resolution": "resolved", "drop_detail": null, "fusion_rank": 15, "rerank_rank": null, "fusion_score": 0.013514, "rerank_score": null, "channel_ranks": {"pgp": 14}, "parse_quality": {"warnings": [], "char_count": 0, "block_count": 0, "table_count": 0, "ocr_confidence": null, "text_yield_per_page": null}, "chunks_selected": 3}, {"title": "Rates", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/rates/?linkLoc=taskbar", "authority": "supporting", "cache_hit": true, "staleness": "unknown_age", "dropped_by": null, "parse_path": "html_trafilatura", "resolution": "resolved", "drop_detail": null, "fusion_rank": 16, "rerank_rank": null, "fusion_score": 0.013158, "rerank_score": null, "channel_ranks": {"pgp": 16}, "parse_quality": {"warnings": [], "char_count": 0, "block_count": 0, "table_count": 0, "ocr_confidence": null, "text_yield_per_page": null}, "chunks_selected": 1}], "expansions": [], "reranked_by": "pgp:cross-encoder", "cache_hit_rate": 1, "expanded_query": "", "forbidden_count": 0, "stale_index_count": 0}, "notices": ["12 cited document(s) have no parseable date; treat their currency as unverified and check the field map."], "refused": false, "citations": [{"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "span": "You have many options for making payments.\n\nSet up automatic payments With automatic payments, your payment is debited monthly from your checking or savings account. To set up automatic payments, sign on , select your auto loan from Account Summary, and then select Set up Autopay . You can also call us at 1-800-289-8004 or download the automatic loan payments authorization (PDF) , complete the form, and return by mail or fax.\n\nPay by phone Call 1-800-289-8004 , 24 hours a day, 7 days a week, to use our automated system.\n\nPay by mail Make your check or money order payable to Wells Fargo Auto. B", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Auto loans FAQs | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_d5df1db5114b4d44", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 2, "heading_path": ["Auto loan FAQs", "Auto loan payments"], "rerank_score": 0.713853}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "span": "If you''d like to change your automatic payment, you''ll need to cancel the recurring schedule and then set up Autopay again. To cancel your automatic payments, sign on , select your auto loan from Account Summary, and then select Manage Autopay . Please allow at least 3 business days before the automatic payment is scheduled to withdraw.\n\nAs an Online Banking customer, you have access to view, download, and print up to 12 months of auto loan statements. If you''d like to stop receiving paper statements in the mail, sign on to your account and select Manage delivery preferences .\n\nBefore you appl", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_a58d027db38525e3", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 1, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan Help", "You have questions, we have answers"], "rerank_score": 0.648032}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "span": "- Ensure your documents are clear, legible, and include all pages \u2013 even blank ones\n\nWe''ll review your documents and contact you if we need additional information.\n\n## Payment challenges\n\nYes, you have options that can help if you''re having trouble with payments. For example, you can change your payment due date or defer a payment. Learn more about your options at help with auto loan payments .\n\nA payment deferment pushes out your due date and extends the loan maturity date.\n\nCall us for more information and to see if you\u2019re eligible for a deferment.\n\nWe can work with you on payment arrangemen", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Auto loans FAQs | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_2d1a80b2e93f275e", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 2, "heading_path": ["Auto loan FAQs", "Auto loan payments"], "rerank_score": 0.702167}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "span": "As an Online Banking customer, you have access to view, download, and print up to 12 months of auto loan statements. If you''d like to stop receiving paper statements in the mail, sign on to your account and select Manage delivery preferences .\n\nBefore you apply for a due date change, you''ll need to meet the following criteria:\n\n- You''ve made the first payment on your auto loan.\n\n- This is your first payment due date change. (You''re allowed one payment due date change for the entire term of the loan.)\n\n- Your account is current or no more than 10 days past due.\n\nIf you change your due date, you", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_3d993090c2ab7c74", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 1, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan Help", "You have questions, we have answers"], "rerank_score": 0.619754}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "span": "If a payment is returned unpaid, we may attempt to present the payment to your financial institution one more time. Your financial institution may charge a fee each time the payment is returned. If the payment doesn''t clear, you''ll need to resubmit the payment once you have sufficient funds in your bank account.\n\nThe SCRA may allow us to adjust the interest rate on your auto loan to 6%, which may lower the payment. For more information, refer to the Servicemembers Civil Relief Act or call us at 1-877-254-9687 , Monday \u2013 Friday, 7 am - 8 pm Central Time. For general account assistance, call us ", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Auto loans FAQs | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_2413f3a2c0de4adc", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 2, "heading_path": ["Auto loan FAQs", "Payment challenges"], "rerank_score": 0.641803}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "span": "You could have a quick credit decision, typically the same day.\n\nFor most applications, you can track your application status online if you share your email address with us at the time of application. We''ll send you an email telling you how.\n\nWith automatic payments, your payment is debited monthly from your checking or savings account. To set up automatic payments, sign on , select your auto loan from Account Summary, and then select Set up Autopay . You can also call us at 1-800-289-8004 or download the automatic loan payments authorization (PDF) , complete the form, and return by mail or fa", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_931ef227c19f432f", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 1, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan Help", "You have questions, we have answers"], "rerank_score": 0.616952}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/home-lending", "span": "We can help you understand your options if you are facing payment challenges. Call 1-800-678-7986 .\n\n## Tools and Calculators\n\n- Get prequalified\n\n### Call Us\n\nGive Us Feedback", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Home Lending Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/home-lending", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_d0c1752e51064f66", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 3, "heading_path": ["Home Lending Help", "Top Questions", "Who do I contact if I am having trouble paying my mortgage?"], "rerank_score": 0.578065}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/personal-loan-faqs/?sub_channel=WEB&vendor_code=WF&linkloc=FNPLFAQ", "span": "For most applications, you can track your application status online if you share your email address with us at the time of application. We''ll send you an email telling you how.\n\nFor most applications, you can track your application status online if you share your email address with us at the time of application. We''ll send you an email telling you how.\n\n- Call us to pay by phone 1-877-269-6056 Monday \u2013 Friday 7:00 am \u2013 7:00 pm Central Time\n\n- Mail your payment in U.S. dollars payable to Wells Fargo Bank, N.A. Mailed payments must be in the form of a personal check, cashier\u2019s check or money ord", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan FAQs \u2013 Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/personal-loan-faqs/?sub_channel=WEB&vendor_code=WF&linkloc=FNPLFAQ", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_ca038359d118b417", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 5, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan FAQs", "Loan Decisioning Process"], "rerank_score": 0.503626}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/home-lending", "span": "- VA loans offer low- and no-down-payment options for eligible veterans and other eligible borrowers. Up to 100% financing may be available on VA loans for qualified borrowers.\n\n### Can I make a mortgage payment online?\n\nYes, you can make a payment and manage your mortgage account online, anytime. Gain instant access to your mortgage account details, loan history, tax and interest data, contact information updates, and more. It''s fast and simple. Get more details", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Home Lending Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/home-lending", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_cb8e6eb60c7fb873", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 3, "heading_path": ["Home Lending Help", "Top Questions", "What is the minimum down payment for conventional, FHA, and VA loans?"], "rerank_score": 0.468028}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/personal-loan-faqs/?sub_channel=WEB&vendor_code=WF&linkloc=FNPLFAQ", "span": "Representative example of repayment terms for an unsecured personal loan: For $17,000 borrowed over 48 months at 13.99% Annual Percentage Rate (APR), the monthly payment is $464. This example is an estimate only and assumes all payments are made on time.\n\nBefore you apply, we encourage you to carefully consider whether consolidating your existing debt is the right choice for you. Consolidating multiple debts means you will have a single payment monthly, but it may not reduce or pay your debt off sooner. The payment reduction may come from a lower interest rate, a longer loan term, or a combina", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan FAQs \u2013 Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/personal-loan-faqs/?sub_channel=WEB&vendor_code=WF&linkloc=FNPLFAQ", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_b4bc5c8f8b9ac65c", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 5, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan FAQs", "How can we help?"], "rerank_score": 0.490504}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/checking-savings", "span": "QSR-12172026-8084652.1.1\n\n### Call Us\n\nGive Us Feedback", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Checking and Savings Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/checking-savings", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_44ae0fb27870a4c2", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 4, "heading_path": ["Checking and Savings Help", "Applications and Rates"], "rerank_score": 0.45112}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/contact-us", "span": "Auto Loans FAQs >\n\n### Personal Loans\n\nPersonal Loan FAQs >\n\nServicing:\n\n### Wells Fargo Advisors Full Service Brokerage\n\nNew Customers\n\nHow Do I...\n\n### WellsTrade \u00ae Online Brokerage\n\nNew Customers\n\nHow Do I...\n\n### Intuitive Investor \u00ae\n\nNew Customers", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Wells Fargo Customer Service Contact Us Numbers | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/contact-us", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_50af1f453575b900", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 11, "heading_path": ["Contact Us", "Find the right contact to get help quickly", "Auto Loans"], "rerank_score": 0.539028}], "conflicts": [{"subject": "days your (days)", "citations": [{"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "span": "You have many options for making payments.\n\nSet up automatic payments With automatic payments, your payment is debited monthly from your checking or savings account. To set up automatic payments, sign on , select your auto loan from Account Summary, and then select Set up Autopay . You can also call us at 1-800-289-8004 or download the automatic loan payments authorization (PDF) , complete the form, and return by mail or fax.\n\nPay by phone Call 1-800-289-8004 , 24 hours a day, 7 days a week, to use our automated system.\n\nPay by mail Make your check or money order payable to Wells Fargo Auto. B", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Auto loans FAQs | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_d5df1db5114b4d44", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 2, "heading_path": ["Auto loan FAQs", "Auto loan payments"], "rerank_score": 0.713853}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "span": "As an Online Banking customer, you have access to view, download, and print up to 12 months of auto loan statements. If you''d like to stop receiving paper statements in the mail, sign on to your account and select Manage delivery preferences .\n\nBefore you apply for a due date change, you''ll need to meet the following criteria:\n\n- You''ve made the first payment on your auto loan.\n\n- This is your first payment due date change. (You''re allowed one payment due date change for the entire term of the loan.)\n\n- Your account is current or no more than 10 days past due.\n\nIf you change your due date, you", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_3d993090c2ab7c74", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 1, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan Help", "You have questions, we have answers"], "rerank_score": 0.619754}]}, {"subject": "loan months payment (months)", "citations": [{"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "span": "If you''d like to change your automatic payment, you''ll need to cancel the recurring schedule and then set up Autopay again. To cancel your automatic payments, sign on , select your auto loan from Account Summary, and then select Manage Autopay . Please allow at least 3 business days before the automatic payment is scheduled to withdraw.\n\nAs an Online Banking customer, you have access to view, download, and print up to 12 months of auto loan statements. If you''d like to stop receiving paper statements in the mail, sign on to your account and select Manage delivery preferences .\n\nBefore you appl", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_a58d027db38525e3", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 1, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan Help", "You have questions, we have answers"], "rerank_score": 0.648032}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/personal-loan-faqs/?sub_channel=WEB&vendor_code=WF&linkloc=FNPLFAQ", "span": "Representative example of repayment terms for an unsecured personal loan: For $17,000 borrowed over 48 months at 13.99% Annual Percentage Rate (APR), the monthly payment is $464. This example is an estimate only and assumes all payments are made on time.\n\nBefore you apply, we encourage you to carefully consider whether consolidating your existing debt is the right choice for you. Consolidating multiple debts means you will have a single payment monthly, but it may not reduce or pay your debt off sooner. The payment reduction may come from a lower interest rate, a longer loan term, or a combina", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Personal Loan FAQs \u2013 Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/personal-loan-faqs/?sub_channel=WEB&vendor_code=WF&linkloc=FNPLFAQ", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_b4bc5c8f8b9ac65c", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 5, "heading_path": ["Personal Loan FAQs", "How can we help?"], "rerank_score": 0.490504}]}], "followups": [{"because": "these passages", "q