hat should I expect after I apply online?", "How do I pay my bill?"], "rerank_score": 0.4}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "span": "You have many options for making payments.\n\nSet up automatic payments With automatic payments, your payment is debited monthly from your checking or savings account. To set up automatic payments, sign on , select your auto loan from Account Summary, and then select Set up Autopay . You can also call us at 1-800-289-8004 or download the automatic loan payments authorization (PDF) , complete the form, and return by mail or fax.\n\nPay by phone Call 1-800-289-8004 , 24 hours a day, 7 days a week, to use our automated system.\n\nPay by mail Make your check or money order payable to Wells Fargo Auto. B", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Auto loans FAQs | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/loans/auto-loans-faqs", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_d5df1db5114b4d44", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 9, "heading_path": ["Auto loan FAQs", "Auto loan payments"], "rerank_score": 0.7}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/online-banking/zelle-faqs", "span": "When you\u2019re setting up your payment, turn on the Repeat payment toggle. This will allow you to set up a payment series or use the calendar to schedule a single payment sometime in the future.\n\nPayments can be scheduled up to a year in advance. Keep in mind you can only send a scheduled or repeating payment to enrolled Zelle \u00ae users.\n\nGo to Scheduled to see all of your future payments, including one-time payments or any repeating series. Once each payment is complete, it will move to Activity , along with other completed payments.\n\nYou can also access canceled payments in Scheduled, for up to t", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Send and Receive Money with Zelle \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/online-banking/zelle-faqs", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_5ad9d57580c161de", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 10, "heading_path": ["Zelle \u00ae Questions"], "rerank_score": 0.4}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/online-banking/zelle-faqs", "span": "You can check the payment status in your Zelle \u00ae Activity . In some cases, payments may be delayed or blocked for your protection.\n\nFor additional help, you can call Wells Fargo Online Customer Service at 1-800-956-4442 , 24 hours a day, 7 days a week.\n\nSame-day Zelle payments are sent immediately. If your recipient has already enrolled with Zelle \u00ae , the payment is sent directly to their bank account and cannot be canceled. Keep in mind that Zelle \u00ae transactions are not covered by the same protections as credit card and debit card payments.\n\nIf the payment is still pending because your recipi", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Send and Receive Money with Zelle \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/online-banking/zelle-faqs", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_ef1ec42f872c4fbb", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 10, "heading_path": ["Zelle \u00ae Questions"], "rerank_score": 0.1}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/online-banking/zelle-faqs", "span": "Some customers with a consumer account may see higher limits in Zelle \u00ae from time to time, based on risk factors and payment history. If we let you send a single payment for more than $3,500, this payment will use up your 24-hour limit.\n\nYour rolling daily limit is the maximum you can send over a period of time going back 24 hours. Your rolling 30-day limit is the maximum you can send over a period of time going back 30 days.\n\nFor more information about Zelle \u00ae , see the Zelle \u00ae Transfer Service Addendum .\n\nOnce your recipient enrolls either a U.S. mobile phone number or email address with Zel", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Send and Receive Money with Zelle \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/online-banking/zelle-faqs", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_42f1be4112e244dd", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 10, "heading_path": ["Zelle \u00ae Questions"], "rerank_score": 0.1}], "conflicts": [], "followups": [{"because": "these passages", "question": "Can I change my payment due date?"}, {"because": "these passages", "question": "How do I set up automatic payments?"}, {"because": "these passages", "question": "How do I pay by phone?"}, {"because": "these passages", "question": "How do I check the payment status in my Zelle Activity?"}], "answered_by": {"cited": [3, 4], "model": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "grounded": true, "provider": "langchain"}, "refusal_reason": null}'::jsonb, '[{"ms": "under 1 ms", "name": "compile", "label": "Compiling scope and permissions", "detail": "plan pln_1ff5bffe14bd0cb6", "status": "ok"}, {"ms": "2455 ms", "name": "candidates", "label": "Searching the index and the store", "detail": "pgp 16, ecm 0", "status": "ok"}, {"ms": "95 ms", "name": "resolve", "label": "Resolving candidates against the store", "detail": "16 candidates, 0 stale, 0 forbidden", "status": "ok"}, {"ms": "24 ms", "name": "passages", "label": "Recovering passages", "detail": "cache 100%", "status": "ok"}, {"ms": "930 ms", "name": "rerank", "label": "Reranking", "detail": "5 passages above the floor", "status": "ok"}, {"name": "answer", "label": "Composing a grounded answer", "detail": "cited 2 of 5 passages", "status": "ok"}]'::jsonb, true, NULL, '{"cited": [3, 4], "model": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "grounded": true, "provider": "langchain"}'::jsonb, 7245, NULL, '2026-08-24 04:24:44.537711+00:00', '2026-08-24 04:24