r, or Zelle \u00ae tag before you send money.\n\nOnce a payment has been sent, it can\u2019t be reversed.\n\nWe\u2019ll email you and send you a secure inbox message whenever you schedule a payment or make changes to a payment. You\u2019ll also get email notifications if a payment fails or is canceled. Make sure the information in your profile is up to date so you can get those messages.\n\nWells Fargo may also send y", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Send and Receive Money with Zelle \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/online-banking/zelle-faqs", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_5e975142beda97b2", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 1, "heading_path": ["Zelle \u00ae Questions"], "rerank_score": 1}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/online-banking/zelle-faqs", "span": "You can check the payment status in your Zelle \u00ae Activity . In some cases, payments may be delayed or blocked for your protection.\n\nFor additional help, you can call Wells Fargo Online Customer Service at 1-800-956-4442 , 24 hours a day, 7 days a week.\n\nSame-day Zelle payments are sent immediately. If your recipient has already enrolled with Zelle \u00ae , the payment is sent directly to their bank account and cannot be canceled. Keep in mind that Zelle \u00ae transactions are not covered by the same protections as credit card and debit card payments.\n\nIf the payment is still pending because your recipi", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Send and Receive Money with Zelle \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/online-banking/zelle-faqs", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_ef1ec42f872c4fbb", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 1, "heading_path": ["Zelle \u00ae Questions"], "rerank_score": 0.7}, {"url": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/online-banking", "span": "How was your experience? Give us feedback.\n\nEnrollment with Zelle \u00ae through Wells Fargo Online \u00ae or Wells Fargo Business Online \u00ae is required. Terms and conditions apply. To send or receive money with Zelle \u00ae , both parties must have an eligible checking or savings account enrolled with Zelle \u00ae through their bank. Transactions between enrolled users typically occur in minutes. For your protection, Zelle \u00ae should only be used for sending money to friends, family, or others you trust. Neither Wells Fargo nor Zelle \u00ae offers purchase protection for payments made with Zelle \u00ae - for example, if you ", "owner": "crawler", "space": "WELLSFARGO_HELP_CENTER", "title": "Online Banking Help | Wells Fargo", "doc_id": "https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/online-banking", "labels": ["crawled"], "chunk_id": "chk_343dc7d7e7e7c2ad", "authority": "supporting", "staleness": "unknown_age", "updated_at": null, "fusion_rank": 2, "heading_path": ["Online Banking Help", "How can we help?"], "rerank_score": 0.4}], "conflicts": [], "followups": [{"because": "these passages", "question": "How do I check the payment status in my Zelle Activity?"}, {"because": "these passages", "question": "What happens if a payment has been sent?"}, {"because": "these passages", "question": "What notifications will I get if a payment fails or is canceled?"}, {"because": "these passages", "question": "How can I make sure the information in my profile is up to date?"}], "answered_by": {"cited": [1, 2], "model": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "grounded": true, "provider": "langchain"}, "refusal_reason": null}'::jsonb, '[{"ms": "under 1 ms", "name": "compile", "label": "Compiling scope and permissions", "detail": "plan pln_2829044e9f99b67c", "status": "ok"}, {"ms": "1073 ms", "name": "candidates", "label": "Searching the index and the store", "detail": "pgp 16, ecm 1", "status": "ok"}, {"ms": "91 ms", "name": "resolve", "label": "Resolving candidat